  "ruleText": "En 1003.01 Optional Pre-Application Report. Prior to submitting an application, a potential applicant shall have the option to request a pre-application report from the utility pursuant to En 1006.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
